Package: cage
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Wayland kiosk compositor (kiosk build)
 Cage runs a single, maximized Wayland application in kiosk mode.
 This build adds kiosk options to upstream cage: -t <transform>
 output rotation, -T touch-only seat, -c X,Y initial cursor
 position, and input device to output mapping for unnamed
 devices (combined display panels).
 Built against the matching libwlroots-0.20 package from this
 repository (Debian trixie only ships wlroots 0.18).
